    "output": {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " 820→\n 821→\t\t\t\t\t\tif (MAX_TURNS > 0 && used > MAX_TURNS) {\n 822→\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttoolsBlocked.add(api.conversationId);\n 823→\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlimitHits.set(api.conversationId, (limitHits.get(api.conversationId) ?? 0) + 1);\n 824→\t\t\t\t\t\t\textra.push({\n 825→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trole: \"system\",\n 826→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcontent: TURN_LIMIT_INSTRUCTION,\n 827→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttimestamp: Date.now(),\n 828→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t});\n 829→\t\t\t\t\t\t\tconsole.warn(\n 830→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t`[agent] 会话 ${api.conversationId}（run ${String(live?.run?.taskId)}）工具回合达上限 ${MAX_TURNS}`,\n 831→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t);\n 832→\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (used > MAX_TURNS + HARD_STOP_GRACE && !aborting.has(key)) {\n 833→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taborting.add(key);\n 834→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tconsole.warn(`[agent] 会话 ${api.conversationId} 无视上限，硬停这一轮`);\n 835→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tvoid abortRun(api.conversationId);\n 836→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n 837→\t\t\t\t\t\t} else if (used === 1) {\n 838→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 新的一轮，把上一轮封掉的工具放开\n 839→\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttoolsBlocked.delete(api.conversationId);\n 840→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 防打转守卫同步清零（批次A A1）：判据按轮计，不跨轮累计\n 841→\t\t\t\t\t\t\tresetLoopGuard(api.conversationId);\n 842→\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n 843→\n 844→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 执事轮输入（2026-11-08 员工人格化刀一 E1/E5）：岗位契约 + 当前在办。\n 845→\t\t\t\t\t\t//\n 846→\t\t\t\t\t\t// **两类执事轮都走这一条**：私聊/例行（partner-runtime.runPartnerTurn）与\n 847→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 群成员轮（group-runtime.buildMemberInput）用的都是同一条 harness +\n 848→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 同一个扩展，所以在这里按会话认执事即可——不必在两处装配代码里各写一遍\n 849→\t\t\t\t\t\t// （写两遍反而会让群轮看到两份）。总管 / 主人会话（partnerIdOfSession=null）\n 850→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 不注入；SOUL 仍在 instructions 里，这里只补契约与状态。\n 851→\t\t\t\t\t\t//\n 852→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 只在本轮**第一次**模型请求时算（used===1）：在办清单要扫 chancellor 的\n 853→\t\t\t\t\t\t// runs/ 目录、开 sqlite，一轮里几十次工具回合各算一遍纯属浪费；这一轮开始\n 854→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 时看到的在办，就是这一轮的\"当前在办\"。\n 855→\t\t\t\t\t\t//\n 856→\t\t\t\t\t\t// 走 system 消息而不是拼进用户正文：状态每轮都变，拼进正文会被固化进\n 857→\t\t\t\t\t\t// transcript（既污染历史，又让模型每轮重读一段旧状态）。\n 858→\t\t\t\t\t\tif (used === 1 && COMPANIONS_ENABLED) {\n 859→\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttry {\n 860→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tconst partnerId = partnersStore().partnerIdOfSession(api.conversationId);\n 861→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (partnerId) {\n 862→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tconst turnContext = buildPartnerTurnContext(\n 863→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tpartnerId,\n 864→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tapi.conversationId,\n 865→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{ workSummary: workSummaryFor },\n 866→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t);\n 867→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (turnContext.text) {\n 868→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\textra.push({\n 869→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trole: \"system\",\n 870→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcontent: turnContext.text,\n 871→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttimestamp: Date.now(),\n 872→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t});\n 873→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n 874→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n 875→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t} catch (error) {\n 876→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 档案 / 任务中心读失败：这一轮少一段状态，但对话不能哑\n 877→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tconsole.warn(\n 878→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t`[partner] 会话 ${api.conversationId} 上下文装配失败: ${\n 879→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\terror instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error)\n 880→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}`,\n 881→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t);\n 882→\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n 883→\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n 884→\n 885→\t\t\t\t\t\tif (extra.length === 0) return undefined;\n 886→\t\t\t\t\t\treturn { messages: [...extra, ...request.messages] };\n 887→\t\t\t\t\t},\n 888→\t\t\t\t}),\n 889→\t\t\t],\n 890→\t\t\ttasks: [ReminderTask, RoutineTask, TopicTask],\n 891→\t\t})),\n 892→\t);\n 893→\n 894→\t// 课题研究专线的最小扩展：摘掉 lifediaryExt（人格 / 技能 / 课题 section 全不要）后，\n 895→\t// 仍然要能拿到 web_search。TOPICS_ENABLED=false 时整块不装（一行回滚）。\n 896→\tif (TOPICS_ENABLED) {\n 897→\t\tresearchExt = defineExtension({\n 898→\t\t\tname: \"lifediary-research\",\n 899→\t\t\ttools: lifediaryTools.filter((tool) => tool.name === \"web_search\"),\n 900→\t\t});\n 901→\t\tregistry.install(researchExt);\n 902→\t}\n 903→\n 904→\t// 可靠性旋钮（2026-11-04 批次一 A4）：全空时 settings 为 undefined，就是\"不传\"。\n 905→\tconst settings = buildHarnessSettings(process.env);\n 906→\tconst reliability = reliabilitySummary(process.env);\n 907→\tconsole.log(\n 908→\t\t`[可靠性] bash默认超时=${reliability.bashTimeoutS > 0 ? `${reliability.bashTimeoutS}s` : \"禁用\"} ` +\n 909→\t\t\t`stream.timeoutMs=${reliability.streamTimeoutMs ?? \"未设(SDK默认10min)\"} ` +\n 910→"
