        "text": "Important: delegation tests use domain \"前端\" and shared module-level streak state across tests. If I wire failure streak into settle, tests that repeatedly finish needs_you with same domain could trigger hint unexpectedly. Most tests use done. But cross-test state pollution: module singleton persists. A test that gets 3 needs_you same domain could then affect another test. Better: make the streak instance injectable via DelegationRuntime (`failureStreak?`) defaulting to module singleton. Tests all use default though. We can make domain source specific. Tests use unique domains mostly.\n\nLet me check needs_you tests in delegation.test.ts / partner-work.test.ts."
