    "rawContent": [
      {
        "type": "reasoning_text",
        "text": "Only one needs_you settle test, fine. To be safe and testable, I'll add an optional `streak?: FailureStreak` in DelegationRuntime? But that adds surface. Alternative: export `resetFailureStreak()` and have tests reset. But existing tests don't. Since only one needs_you test with domain \"\" maybe source \"worker\". No 3x trigger. Fine.\n\nBut \"汇报行（349-350）\" is formatReport. To attach hint test, I'd rather put takeover param in formatReport and unit test directly.\n\nNow also decide where failure recording happens relative to canceled/idle. Record only when status done/needs_you/failed/aborted? In settle, before `if (canceled) return;`? Cancel is user action, shouldn't count as model failure. Place after canceled check? Let's compute after canceled guard:\n\n```ts\nconst source = kick.domain || \"worker\";\nlet takeover = false;\nif (result.status === \"done\") failureStreak().recordSuccess(source);\nelse if (result.status === \"needs_you\" || result.status === \"failed\" || result.status === \"aborted\") {\n  const outcome = failureStreak().recordFailure(source, result.status === \"needs_you\" ? \"needs_you\" : \"unresolved\");\n  takeover = outcome.suggestTakeover && takeoverHintEnabled();\n}\n```\nBut `failed` in settle means formatReport \"failed\" for status idle? formatReport maps anything not done/needs_you/aborted to failed; but idle doesn't reach report (autoReport skipped) yet settle still runs. result.status \"idle\" should not count as failure. So restrict as above.\n\nAlso `fail()` path (派单失败) counts as \"unresolved\"? Not needed per task (4.4 only two spots); but maybe include for consistency? Keep minimal: settle only.\n\nNow, attention event question append:\n```ts\nconst baseQuestion = result.attention.question;\nquestion: takeover ? `${baseQuestion}\\n${TAKEOVER_HINT}` : baseQuestion\n```\nFixed text; dynamic question allowed (it's already dynamic).\n\nReport: `formatReport(result, kick.domain, { takeover })`.\n\nNote `report` created before emit delegate message and attention event currently. takeover computed before.\n\nNow #5 contract default body. partnerContractTemplate:\n```ts\nexport function partnerContractTemplate(): string {\n  const defaults: Partial<Record<...string>> = { 决策分级: [...] };\n  return SECTION.map(s => `## ${s}${defaults[s] ? `\\n${defaults[s]}` : \"\"}`).join(\"\\n\\n\");\n}\n```\nBody text per task:\n- 没有调查不许改：先复现、再看现象、再动手；猜着改三次不如查一次。\n- 同一条思路连修 3 次还不行 → 停下，把已查明的事写成一段话交上去，别继续硬修。\n- 交付物要自带验收证据：说\"做完了\"要能指出凭什么。\n\nPut in 决策分级. Also maybe 验收标准? Task says 决策分级 only.\n\nExisting test asserts `renderContractSection(template) === undefined` → will fail: now 决策分级 has body → renders section. Update test: assert template still has four headings verbatim, contains 调查铁律, renderContractSection includes 决策分级. Also line 90 asserts v1 contractSource === partnerContractTemplate() (fine). Test line 65 fine.\n\n\"存量执事不动\" — seedContract only for new; no migration. Good.\n\n#7.2 doc: architecture §7. Let's inspect 系统架构.md §7."
      }
    ],
