        "type": "reasoning_text",
        "text": "No cycle. delegation → agent/turn-gate → approvals → nothing. OK. But architecturally delegation.ts is imported by turn-gate? no. Fine.\n\nAlternatively put TAKEOVER_HINT in failure-streak.ts? Task explicitly says turn-gate constant. Follow.\n\nNow formatReport signature:\n\n```ts\nexport function formatReport(result, domain, options: { takeover?: boolean } = {}): DelegationReport {\n...\n? `有一项需要你处理：${q}${options.takeover ? `（${TAKEOVER_HINT}）` : \"\"}`\n```\n\nNow in settle compute. Note settle early-returns if canceled. Place after canceled return, before report.\n\n```ts\n// 同类失败连击（批 12 §一.4）：按 domain 记连续失败；成功一次清零。\nconst streakSource = kick.domain || \"worker\";\nlet takeover = false;\nif (result.status === \"done\") {\n  failureStreak().recordSuccess(streakSource);\n} else if (result.status === \"needs_you\" || result.status === \"failed\" || result.status === \"aborted\") {\n  const { suggestTakeover } = failureStreak().recordFailure(\n    streakSource,\n    result.status === \"needs_you\" ? \"needs_you\" : \"unresolved\",\n  );\n  takeover = suggestTakeover && takeoverHintEnabled();\n}\nconst report = formatReport(result, kick.domain, { takeover });\n```\n\nAttention event: `question: takeover ? `${question}\\n${TAKEOVER_HINT}` : question`.\n\nWait: if takeover hint should append to attention question only for needs_you (attention only exists for needs_you), fine.\n\nBut careful: `formatReport` with takeover true adds hint to report.text (truncated 80). Both places get it — as requested.\n\nTests for delegation streak: Need to test through startDelegation 3 times with same domain, but module singleton accumulates across tests. Use unique domain per test (e.g. \"streak-test\"). And reset before by calling resetFailureStreak? Export reset for tests. Simpler in test: use `failureStreak()` directly and unique domain. But to prove wiring, use startDelegation. Add `resetFailureStreak()` exported (also useful ops?). Could avoid extra API by using unique domain strings. But other tests could accidentally use same domain; unlikely. I'll still export `resetFailureStreak`? It's a small clean API and helps tests. Hmm \"不做无关\" — it's directly testability. Include.\n\nSwitch AGENT_TAKEOVER_HINT read lazily (function), so test can toggle.\n\nNow #3: delegate description additions. Where exactly? Append at end after attention sentence:\n\n```ts\n\"工人回报「需要你」...\" +\n// 2026-11-10 批 12 §一.3：派活时把四行回报口径一起交待下去。\n\"**派活前告诉工人按四行回报**（开头写「给<你的名字>：」，不要把任务原样发回给派活的人）：\\n\" +\nREPORT_FOUR_LINES +\n// 2026-11-10 批 12 §一.2：裁决纪律也在同一处给总管/执事看。\n\"\\n\\n\" + RULING_DISCIPLINE\n```\n\nNote description is a single concatenated string; newlines fine.\n\nImport in tools.ts: RULING_DISCIPLINE from \"./agent/turn-gate.ts\", REPORT_FOUR_LINES from \"./delegation.ts\". Check tools.ts existing imports of delegation."
      }
