        "type": "reasoning_text",
        "text": "Now update partner-context.test.ts at lines 65-67 and 287-306.\n\nTest 1:\n```\nassert.equal(store.readContractFromHome(partner.id), partnerContractTemplate());\n// 空模板...\nassert.equal(renderContractSection(...), undefined);\n```\nChange to:\n```\nassert.equal(store.readContractFromHome(partner.id), partnerContractTemplate());\n// 四节标题逐字保留；「决策分级」带调查铁律默认正文（批 12）\nconst seeded = partnerContractTemplate();\nfor (const section of PARTNER_CONTRACT_SECTIONS) assert.ok(seeded.includes(`## ${section}`));\nassert.match(seeded, /没有调查不许改/);\nassert.match(renderContractSection(seeded) ?? \"\", /## 决策分级[\\s\\S]*同一条思路连修 3 次/);\n```\nBut test title \"播种四节空模板\" update.\n\nTest \"空态省略\" lines 284-292:\n```\nassert.match(context.soul,...)\nassert.equal(context.contract,null)\nassert.equal(context.status,null)\nassert.match(context.guard ?? \"\", /【材料安全】/);\nassert.equal(context.text, context.guard, \"没有契约/在办时只注入防线\");\n```\nNow text = discipline + guard. Update:\n```\nassert.match(context.discipline, /【验证铁律】/); // partner 非 chief\nassert.match(context.text ?? \"\", /【裁决纪律】/);\nassert.equal(context.text, `${context.discipline}\\n\\n${context.guard}`);\n...\nbare: guard null, text === discipline (not undefined)\n```\nUpdate assertions and comments.\n\nAlso add new tests for disciplines and chief skip. Let's edit tests."
      }
