    "output": {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " 395→\t\t// 既有 UNIQUE (partner_id, role, route_key) 已覆盖这个组合，无需改约束。\n 396→\t\tif (domain) this.linkDelegation(id, domain);\n 397→\t\treturn this.get(id) as PartnerRow;\n 398→\t}\n 399→\n 400→\t/**\n 401→\t * 总管专用播种（批次D D1）：固定 id `\"chief\"`，首次启动建档案 + 家 + v1 身份快照。\n 402→\t * **幂等**：档案 / SOUL.md / 版本任一已存在都不动——二次启动绝不覆盖用户改过的 SOUL\n 403→\t * （含通过 PATCH/bumpSoul 推进过的新版本）。\n 404→\t * 播种正文 = 传入的 PERSONA 原文（运行时值），保证首启 persona 与改动前逐字一致。\n 405→\t */\n 406→\tensureChief(seedSoul: string): void {\n 407→\t\tif (!this.get(CHIEF_PARTNER_ID)) {\n 408→\t\t\tconst now = new Date().toISOString();\n 409→\t\t\tthis.db\n 410→\t\t\t\t.prepare(\n 411→\t\t\t\t\t\"INSERT INTO partners (id, name, status, current_version, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (?, ?, 'active', NULL, ?, ?)\",\n 412→\t\t\t\t)\n 413→\t\t\t\t.run(CHIEF_PARTNER_ID, CHIEF_PARTNER_NAME, now, now);\n 414→\t\t}\n 415→\t\tthis.ensureHome(CHIEF_PARTNER_ID, CHIEF_PARTNER_NAME, seedSoul);\n 416→\t\tif (!this.currentVersion(CHIEF_PARTNER_ID)) {\n 417→\t\t\tthis.pushVersion(\n 418→\t\t\t\tCHIEF_PARTNER_ID,\n 419→\t\t\t\tthis.readSoulFromHome(CHIEF_PARTNER_ID) ?? seedSoul,\n 420→\t\t\t\tnull,\n 421→\t\t\t\t// 总管刻意不播种岗位契约（他是主人本体，不是被派的执事）；\n 422→\t\t\t\t// 有人手工放了 CONTRACT.md 才读得到，读不到就是 null。\n 423→\t\t\t\tthis.readContractFromHome(CHIEF_PARTNER_ID),\n 424→\t\t\t);\n 425→\t\t}\n 426→\t}\n 427→\n 428→\tget(id: string): PartnerRow | null {\n 429→\t\tconst row = this.db.prepare(\"SELECT * FROM partners WHERE id = ?\").get(id) as\n 430→\t\t\t| Record<string, unknown>\n 431→\t\t\t| undefined;\n 432→\t\treturn row ? toPartner(row) : null;\n 433→\t}\n 434→\n 435→"
    },
